2) chr2L cause: per-founder mean depth, chr2L vs chr2R
   (catalog needs EVERY founder covered; a founder that drops out on
    chr2L would gate out the whole arm. Reads the founder BCFs on disk.)
==================================================================
  --- chr2L (mean DP per founder over first 50k sites) ---
    samples: B1	B2	B3	B4	B5	B6	B7	AB8	
    meanDP :   246.4    46.5   169.0    45.6     7.3    26.4    80.5   153.7
  --- chr2R (mean DP per founder over first 50k sites) ---
    samples: B1	B2	B3	B4	B5	B6	B7	AB8	
    meanDP :   175.1    36.4   121.4    34.4    15.3    20.7    60.6   118.7
  -> a founder whose meanDP collapses on chr2L (vs chr2R) is the culprit;
     if ALL founders drop, it is a chr2L reference/mapping issue, not one BAM.

==================================================================
